linux-laden — GPL-2.0-only
==========================

linux-laden is the Linux kernel as packaged for Laden OS, built from CachyOS
kernel sources and configuration.

Upstream kernel: https://www.kernel.org/ (GPL-2.0-only, with syscall note)
CachyOS kernel packaging/sources: https://github.com/CachyOS/linux-cachyos
Laden packaging scripts (laden-ize.py, update-from-cachyos.sh, PKGBUILD
wrappers): Copyright (c) 2026 Laden AS — these scripts are also distributed
under GPL-2.0-only together with the kernel package they produce.

The full GPL-2.0-only text is in LICENSES/GPL-2.0-only.txt at the repository
root. Do not relicense the kernel as MIT.
